  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Slice potato into halves.\n• Place potato halves on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Arrange so that each potato is cut-side down.\n• Bake until crisp and tender, 35-45 minutes.\n• Remove from oven, then carefully turn each potato to be cut-side up. Sprinkle with plant-based grated cheese.\n• Return to oven to bake until golden, a further 6-8 minutes.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potatoes between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a631fda05b1d5f95fbf-974dde8a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potatoes are baking, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes then set aside.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse half the lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a631fda05b1d5f95fbf-5342c360.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• When the potatoes have 10 minutes remaining, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan, over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion and carrot, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a631fda05b1d5f95fbf-4775c575.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add garlic, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in lentils, coconut milk, vegetable stock powder and the water. Simmer until thickened, 2-4 minutes.\n• Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a631fda05b1d5f95fbf-2620ca37.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the lentils are simmering, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl. Season, then add mixed salad leaves and tomato. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a631fda05b1d5f95fbf-6242bc3b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide potatoes and tomato salad between plates. Top salad with haloumi.\n• Spoon lentils over potatoes. Sprinkle with flaked almonds. Tear over mint leaves.\n• Serve with tamarind chutney. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a631fda05b1d5f95fbf-61a9cea1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
